    given-names: Claude
repository-code: "https://github.com/blazephoenixxyz-crypto/Blaze-Phoenix-Dex"
url: "https://blazephoenix.xyz"
abstract: >-
  An on-chain DeFi router and aggregator that prices routes on the pool's
  measured marginal output rather than self-reported state, with
  quote-equals-execution and fail-closed guarantees, across Uniswap V2/V3/V4,
  Solidly, and Curve. Includes permissionless on-chain Uniswap V4 pool discovery.
keywords:
  - defi
  - dex-aggregator
  - ethereum
  - evm
  - uniswap-v4
  - solidity
  - smart-contracts
